WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.162 --> 00:00:01.509
(ringing of phone)

00:00:01.509 --> 00:00:03.715
- Hey, what's up, Will?

00:00:03.715 --> 00:00:05.178
- Hey, Alaska, what's up?

00:00:05.178 --> 00:00:07.732
- Not much, how about you, dude?

00:00:07.732 --> 00:00:10.100
- Do you maybe want to eat some bagels?

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.191
(clang of percussion)

00:00:11.191 --> 00:00:14.326
- Did you say bagels?

00:00:14.326 --> 00:00:18.280
(upbeat electronic music)

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.696
- Bagels.

00:00:19.696 --> 00:00:21.344
- We're talkin' about bagels.

00:00:21.344 --> 00:00:22.900
- Fresh bagels.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.197
- Bagel angel. (laughs)

00:00:26.197 --> 00:00:27.660
- Poppy seed bagel.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.518
- Sesame seed bagel.

00:00:29.518 --> 00:00:31.700
- Time to toast!

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.977
It's time to toast!

00:00:32.977 --> 00:00:34.710
- It's time to toast!

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.576
- Time to cut the bagel.

00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:41.051
(sawing of knife)

00:00:41.051 --> 00:00:42.322
(squirt)

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:46.089
- Well, what's the matter, buddy?

00:00:46.089 --> 00:00:48.441
- Aah!
(squrting of blood)

00:00:48.441 --> 00:00:49.891
- Will, no, Will!

00:00:49.891 --> 00:00:52.258
(bubbling, squirting of blood)

00:00:52.258 --> 00:00:53.826
(high pitched metallic squeals)

00:00:53.826 --> 00:00:56.816
(shrieking)

00:00:56.816 --> 00:00:58.082
- Why did we do this?

00:00:58.082 --> 00:01:00.154
(clang of percussion)

00:01:00.154 --> 00:01:04.663
- [Voiceover] In 2008, 1,979 people

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:06.799
suffered a BRI.

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.564
These victims were cut so badly

00:01:08.564 --> 00:01:11.025
that they ended up in an emergency room.

00:01:11.025 --> 00:01:13.974
- Bagels, not even once.

00:01:13.974 --> 00:01:15.436
- This advertisement was funded by the

00:01:15.436 --> 00:01:17.364
American Council for More Croissants.

00:01:22.344 --> 00:01:23.563
(electronic whir)

00:01:23.563 --> 00:01:24.904
(rusty squeak)

